WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Open in Chrome. Use an ARCore-compatible Android. From a computer, use the transfer QR.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Allow camera access. Tap Start AR survey. Wait for the floor reticle.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Mark every corner. Walk around in order, including recesses. Do not repeat the first corner.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Check your survey. Finish after at least 3 corners. Use the plan or send it to your computer. JSON or DXF export is available.
